  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nA way to disable or ban users. For the reason that third-party authenticators like Authentik have some users that should be banned from logging in, like an LDAP search user and the akadmin\n\n### Additional information\n\nAdd a simple toggle, only available from the admin interface, to disable a user. The reason to do it in Homarr rather than the third-party service is that some accounts can\u2019t be disabled because another service is using them, so if we can disable them from Homarr, it\u2019s safer.",
